@name     voice_copy
@alias    >
@group    voice
@c_name   skode_clause_voice_copy
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  copy voice state to target voice
@doc
Copies all parameters from the active voice into target voice.
Usage: > dest_voice (or voice_copy dest_voice)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    int dest = (int)args[0];
    if (dest < 0 || dest >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    return voice_copy(voice, dest);
@end
